      <data key="d1">{"algorithm": "jaccard", "diagnosis": {"repair_instructions": ["将 `memory[\"text\"]` 改为 `memory[\"text\"].lower()` 以处理大小写敏感问题", "将 `memory[\"id\"]` 改为 `memory[\"id\"].lower()` 以匹配大小写不敏感的查询", "移除 `chinese_chars` 集合的添加逻辑，因为 Jaccard 算法无法区分大小写", "移除 `english_tokens` 集合的添加逻辑，因为 Jaccard 算法无法区分大小写", "移除 `chinese_chars` 集合的添加逻辑，因为 Jaccard 算法无法区分大小写", "移除 `english_tokens` 集合的添加逻辑，因为 Jaccard 算法无法区分大小写"], "summary": "代码中多次尝试对集合对象使用下标访问，导致类型错误。"}, "evidence": {"code_hash": "34bb0f90d55712bf1d496d9d39d6f939a4b3046b822101e1e72a91d3187ac815", "validation_id": "validation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r2"}, "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r2", "parent": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r1", "scope": "memory_retrieval", "summary": "v01: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v02: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v03: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v04: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v05: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v06: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v07: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v08: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v09: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v10: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v11: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; v12: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; contract:exact: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; contract:repeat: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; contract:large_k: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable; contract:unicode: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "validated_fix": false}</data>
