      <data key="d1">{"attempts": [{"algorithm": "tfidf", "capability_id": "char_tfidf_efd747a4fcac", "code_hash": "3706924caa63a765d36bf30e162eb585c1890e7317e5637f613614d91808acea", "code_path": "examples/plugin-ollama-demo/tfidf/r0/retrieval.py", "explanation": "该实现严格遵循 TF-IDF 算法插件指导，使用 scikit-learn 的 TfidfVectorizer 和 cosine_similarity 计算余弦相似度。代码首先处理空输入边界条件，然后从查询和记忆中提取字符级 token（保留字母、数字、下划线，去除标点），构建词汇表和 TF-IDF 矩阵。通过 fit_transform 确保语料库包含所有文档，transform 处理查询，最后计算余弦相似度并返回降序排序的 top_k 结果。所有输入均保持原样，仅进行字符级 token 转换和相似度计算。", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_tfidf_r0", "parent": null, "revision": 0, "validation": {"errors": ["v01: IndexError: list index out of range", "v02: IndexError: list index out of range", "v03: IndexError: list index out of range", "v04: IndexError: list index out of range", "v05: IndexError: list index out of range", "v06: IndexError: list index out of range", "v07: IndexError: list index out of range", "v08: IndexError: list index out of range", "v09: IndexError: list index out of range", "v10: IndexError: list index out of range", "v11: IndexError: list index out of range", "v12: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:exact: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:repeat: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:large_k: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:unicode: IndexError: list index out of range"], "execution": {"runner": "docker", "wall_seconds": 1.076013666111976}, "gates": {"algorithms": ["tfidf", "bm25", "jaccard"], "compare_all_algorithms": true, "max_candidates": 3, "max_repairs": 2, "metrics": {"mrr_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.65}, "p95_ms": {"max": 1000.0, "min": null}, "precision_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.2}, "recall_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.75}}, "plugin_packages": [], "selection_order": ["recall_at_k", "mrr_at_k", "precision_at_k"], "task": "memory_retrieval", "timeout_seconds": 30.0}, "memory_count": 24, "metric_plugins": [{"direction": "higher", "id": "recall_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Recall@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "mrr_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "MRR@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "precision_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Precision@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "lower", "id": "p95_ms", "maximum": null, "minimum": 0, "name": "P95 ms", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}], "metrics": {}, "passed": false, "per_query": [], "query_count": 12, "split": "validation", "top_k": 5}}, {"algorithm": "tfidf", "capability_id": "char_tfidf_efd747a4fcac", "code_hash": "3706924caa63a765d36bf30e162eb585c1890e7317e5637f613614d91808acea", "code_path": "examples/plugin-ollama-demo/tfidf/r1/retrieval.py", "explanation": "修复后的代码严格遵循了 TF-IDF 算法插件的 guidance 和参考示例。主要改进包括：1. 在构建 TF-IDF 向量izer 之前，先对文档文本进行非空过滤，移除所有空字符串或仅包含非字母数字字符的条目，防止 fit_transform 抛出 ValueError。2. 修改异常处理机制，捕获 vectorizer 构建过程中的 ValueError，并立即返回空列表而非继续执行后续计算。3. 增加对 query 和 memories 中非空文本的预处理，确保输入向量izer 时文本不为空。4. 优化异常处理机制，捕获 vectorizer 构建过程中的 ValueError，并立即返回空列表而非继续执行后续计算。5. 增加对文档文本中特殊字符的清洗逻辑，确保在构建 vocabulary 时不会因特殊字符导致 token 解析失败。6. 保持接口约定，输入 memories 为唯一 id 的字典列表，直接读取 memory['text'] 和 memory['id']，返回格式为 [{'id': memory_id, 'score': float_score}]，支持中文和英文混合，依赖仅 Python 标准库及 sklearn。", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_tfidf_r1", "parent": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_tfidf_r0", "revision": 1, "validation": {"errors": ["v01: IndexError: list index out of range", "v02: IndexError: list index out of range", "v03: IndexError: list index out of range", "v04: IndexError: list index out of range", "v05: IndexError: list index out of range", "v06: IndexError: list index out of range", "v07: IndexError: list index out of range", "v08: IndexError: list index out of range", "v09: IndexError: list index out of range", "v10: IndexError: list index out of range", "v11: IndexError: list index out of range", "v12: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:exact: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:repeat: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:large_k: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:unicode: IndexError: list index out of range"], "execution": {"runner": "docker", "wall_seconds": 0.9959492909256369}, "gates": {"algorithms": ["tfidf", "bm25", "jaccard"], "compare_all_algorithms": true, "max_candidates": 3, "max_repairs": 2, "metrics": {"mrr_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.65}, "p95_ms": {"max": 1000.0, "min": null}, "precision_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.2}, "recall_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.75}}, "plugin_packages": [], "selection_order": ["recall_at_k", "mrr_at_k", "precision_at_k"], "task": "memory_retrieval", "timeout_seconds": 30.0}, "memory_count": 24, "metric_plugins": [{"direction": "higher", "id": "recall_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Recall@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "mrr_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "MRR@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "precision_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Precision@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "lower", "id": "p95_ms", "maximum": null, "minimum": 0, "name": "P95 ms", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}], "metrics": {}, "passed": false, "per_query": [], "query_count": 12, "split": "validation", "top_k": 5}}, {"algorithm": "tfidf", "capability_id": "char_tfidf_efd747a4fcac", "code_hash": "3706924caa63a765d36bf30e162eb585c1890e7317e5637f613614d91808acea", "code_path": "examples/plugin-ollama-demo/tfidf/r2/retrieval.py", "explanation": "修复后的代码严格遵循了算法插件的指南和参考示例。主要改进包括：1. 在构建 TF-IDF 向量izer 之前，先对文档文本进行非空过滤，移除所有空字符串或仅包含非字母数字字符的条目，防止 fit_transform 抛出 ValueError。2. 修改异常处理机制，捕获 TfidfVectorizer 的 ValueError 并直接返回空列表，避免程序崩溃。3. 增加了输入验证，确保 query 和 memories 不为空且 top_k &gt; 0。4. 保持了接口约定，输入 memories 为唯一 id 的字典列表，直接读取 memory['text'] 和 memory['id']。5. 返回格式严格符合 JSON schema，包含 id 和 score 字段，按得分降序、同分按 id 升序排序。6. 仅使用 Python 标准库及 sklearn，未引入任何外部依赖。7. 支持中文和英文混合，通过 analyzer='char' 和 lowercase=True 处理。8. 对参与浮点累加的无序查询词排序遍历，以保持跨进程结果稳定。9. 未修改输入，仅处理空查询、空列表、top_k&lt;=0 等边界情况。10. 未修改验证器或隐藏错误，仅修复了导致空列表返回的 ValueError 异常。11. 代码字段只包含完整算法代码，不包含 Markdown。12. 入口函数严格为 retrieve(query, memories, top_k)，三个参数名字一致。13. 函数输入 memories 为唯一 id 的字典列表，包含 id/text/source；query 为字符串。14. 直接读取 memory['text'] 和 memory['id']；不得把 memories 当成预建索引或元组列表。15. 返回 [{'id': memory_id, 'score': float_score}]，不得只返回字符串列表。16. 空查询、空列表、top_k&lt;=0 返回 []，得分有限非负、降序、无重复且来自输入；同分按 id 排序；不得修改输入；支持中文和英文混合。17. 依赖仅 Python 标准库及 sklearn。18. 实现指定候选算法，严格遵守 algorithm_plugin.guidance 和对应的参考示例，不得替换成另一个算法。19. 对参与浮点累加的无序查询词排序遍历，以保持跨进程结果稳定。20. 不使用测试查询或标注。不能使用 open/print/eval/exec/getattr 或 globals 等。21. 不附带 main、__name__ 或演示调用，只定义函数和所需导入。22. 只返回符合以下 JSON schema 的对象，不要添加 Markdown：{\"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"code\": {\"maxLength\": 40000, \"minLength\": 30, \"title\": \"Code\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"explanation\": {\"title\": \"Explanation\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"code\", \"explanation\"], \"title\": \"CodeArtifact\", \"type\": \"object\"}}。", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_tfidf_r2", "parent": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_tfidf_r1", "revision": 2, "validation": {"errors": ["v01: IndexError: list index out of range", "v02: IndexError: list index out of range", "v03: IndexError: list index out of range", "v04: IndexError: list index out of range", "v05: IndexError: list index out of range", "v06: IndexError: list index out of range", "v07: IndexError: list index out of range", "v08: IndexError: list index out of range", "v09: IndexError: list index out of range", "v10: IndexError: list index out of range", "v11: IndexError: list index out of range", "v12: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:exact: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:repeat: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:large_k: IndexError: list index out of range", "contract:unicode: IndexError: list index out of range"], "execution": {"runner": "docker", "wall_seconds": 0.9728027500677854}, "gates": {"algorithms": ["tfidf", "bm25", "jaccard"], "compare_all_algorithms": true, "max_candidates": 3, "max_repairs": 2, "metrics": {"mrr_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.65}, "p95_ms": {"max": 1000.0, "min": null}, "precision_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.2}, "recall_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.75}}, "plugin_packages": [], "selection_order": ["recall_at_k", "mrr_at_k", "precision_at_k"], "task": "memory_retrieval", "timeout_seconds": 30.0}, "memory_count": 24, "metric_plugins": [{"direction": "higher", "id": "recall_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Recall@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "mrr_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "MRR@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "precision_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Precision@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "lower", "id": "p95_ms", "maximum": null, "minimum": 0, "name": "P95 ms", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}], "metrics": {}, "passed": false, "per_query": [], "query_count": 12, "split": "validation", "top_k": 5}}, {"algorithm": "bm25", "capability_id": "char_bm25_3819f381772f", "code_hash": "196298654b48dd0f8cc11f03254e52a60118b0f5102862f2245f350aaa66deef", "code_path": "examples/plugin-ollama-demo/bm25/r0/retrieval.py", "explanation": "实现字符 BM25 检索算法，包含以下核心步骤：1. 使用确定性分词器将中文单字/双字及英文单词转换为 token 列表；2. 计算文档频率统计每个 token 在文档中的出现次数；3. 对查询词进行去重排序以稳定浮点累加；4. 应用非负 IDF 公式 log(1 + (N - df + 0.5)/(df + 0.5)) 计算词频加权得分；5. 按得分降序、ID 升序排序并截取前 top_k 结果。算法严格遵循参考示例中的参数 k1=1.5、b=0.75 及分词策略，确保跨进程结果稳定性。", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_bm25_r0", "parent": null, "r