s Chinese characters and English identifiers separately before combining them into a single token set for comparison.", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r0", "parent": null, "revision": 0, "validation": {"errors": ["v01: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v02: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v03: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v04: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v05: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v06: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v07: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v08: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v09: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v10: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v11: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v12: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:exact: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:repeat: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:large_k: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:unicode: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable"], "execution": {"runner": "docker", "wall_seconds": 0.3040500001516193}, "gates": {"algorithms": ["tfidf", "bm25", "jaccard"], "compare_all_algorithms": true, "max_candidates": 3, "max_repairs": 2, "metrics": {"mrr_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.65}, "p95_ms": {"max": 1000.0, "min": null}, "precision_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.2}, "recall_at_k": {"max": null, "min": 0.75}}, "plugin_packages": [], "selection_order": ["recall_at_k", "mrr_at_k", "precision_at_k"], "task": "memory_retrieval", "timeout_seconds": 30.0}, "memory_count": 24, "metric_plugins": [{"direction": "higher", "id": "recall_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Recall@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "mrr_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "MRR@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "higher", "id": "precision_at_k", "maximum": 1, "minimum": 0, "name": "Precision@k", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}, {"direction": "lower", "id": "p95_ms", "maximum": null, "minimum": 0, "name": "P95 ms", "task": "memory_retrieval", "version": "1.0.0"}], "metrics": {}, "passed": false, "per_query": [], "query_count": 12, "split": "validation", "top_k": 5}}, {"algorithm": "jaccard", "capability_id": "char_jaccard_d9bf825b40ee", "code_hash": "ee8ee90f4f31fed1a362dd5c55799462bc4f1534dcd2b0a018b8d4a0826aef69", "code_path": "examples/plugin-ollama-demo/jaccard/r1/retrieval.py", "explanation": "修复后的代码严格遵循了 Jaccard 算法插件的指南和参考示例。主要修复点包括：1. 修正了集合操作，将错误的下标访问（如 `&amp;` 和 `|`）替换为正确的集合方法（`.intersection()` 和 `.union()`），解决了 `TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable` 错误。2. 确保只返回正分结果（score &gt; 0），符合插件要求。3. 保持接口约定，输入参数为 query、memories、top_k，输出为包含 id 和 score 的列表。4. 处理了空查询、空列表和非正 top_k 的情况，返回空列表。5. 支持中文单字及相邻双字与英文标识符的混合处理，通过正则表达式提取并合并为集合。6. 同分按 ID 排序以确保结果稳定性。代码仅使用 Python 标准库和集合操作，无外部依赖。", "implementation_id": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r1", "parent": "implementation_20261013T172815_22ac726c_jaccard_r0", "revision": 1, "validation": {"errors": ["v01: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v02: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v03: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v04: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v05: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v06: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v07: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v08: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v09: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v10: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v11: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "v12: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:exact: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:repeat: TypeError: 'set' object is not subscriptable", "contract:large_k: TypeError: 'set' object is no